# Hydrate quality lock (do not regress)

These were already fixed once and leaked back after unrelated hydrate/KC work. **Do not** remove or bypass the post-process. `npm test` must stay green.

## Invariants (code, not prompts)

- **Cover title:** at most 8 words. `shortenCourseTitle` after file analysis and outline.
- **Module title:** short topic label, no Bloom gerunds. `shortenModuleTitle` after outline coverage.
- **Markdown glyphs:** `**bold**` and `###` never show as raw symbols. Choice-card body/reveal/prompt go through `markdownToHtml`. Quiz options and other plain-text surfaces use `stripMarkdownArtifacts`.
- **Click-reveal layout:** intro/prompt left column; reveal rows on the right (`ClickRevealInteraction`). Process and vertical tabs use the same left-intro / right-interaction split (`InteractionIntroColumn`).
- **Intro rail is white** on light theme (`InteractionIntroColumn` panel `#ffffff`). Process / tab / click-reveal **interaction wells keep** light blue or the module color. Do not paint the preamble with `PROCESS_PANEL_DEFAULT`.
- **Continue CTA once.** Process and tabs omit intro `cta`; `formatTabIntroOst` / `stripOstCta` drop “Select below / a topic / a tab to continue”. Empty interaction canvas keeps the prompt. Click-reveal may keep its prompt under the intro (only place).
- **Content section headers:** ALL-CAPS, fully-bold, or topic-lead list items become `###` parents; **only children are bullets** (`parseOstSectionGroups` + `OstSectionGroupsView`). `sanitizeOstText` must keep `###` lines (never `- ### heading`). Do not restore CSS `columns-2` on a flat `ul` for these groups.
- **Scored choice-cards:** prompt must say **correct** and **Check** (`ensureSelectChoicePrompt`).
- **Choice-card faces stay short.** Spec-table rows (`Reaction conditions:`, `Key product:`) move to `reveal` via `compactChoiceCardCopy`. Player applies it at render so existing drafts fix without regenerate. Do not stack four labeled facts on the tile.
- **Key takeaways** are 2–4 module-level points, each a **1–3 sentence summary** (`normalizeKeyTakeaways` + `isRichTakeaway`). Do not apply the 5–8 word teaching-bullet rule. Do not emit ALL-CAPS topic titles or Bloom gerunds as the only on-screen text. Hydrate retries thin title-only takeaways (`teachingSlideNeedsRetry`).
- **Knowledge checks** always have a learner payload and **empty** `voiceOverText` (`ensureKnowledgeCheckPayload` + `stripSlideNarration`). Never convert an incomplete quiz to a `content` slide titled “Knowledge Check”.
- **KC count/place:** `ensureKnowledgeCheckBudget` + `alignHydratedSlidesToOutline`. Teaching slides cannot become quizzes.
- **Enabling coverage:** one module per terminal, 1–2 teaching slides per enabling (`ensureEnablingSlideCoverage`).
- **Teaching slides** are not a single thin subtitle (`teachingSlideNeedsRetry` + `finalizeHydratedSlide`).
- **Tab intro** never includes “Select a tab / below / a topic to continue” (`formatTabIntroOst`).
- **Review script** matches player order/OST (`reviewAlignment.test.ts`).

## How to change generation

Put new hydrate/QC/review behavior **behind these helpers**, then add a failing test first. Prompt-only rules will drift; the lock is the post-process plus `npm test`.
